ass="markdown"><p>We are happy to announce <strong>Docusaurus 2.4</strong>.</p>{"\n"}<p>The upgrade should be easy: as explained in our <a class="" href="/community/release-process">release process documentation</a>, minor versions respect <a href="https://semver.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">Semantic Versioning</a>.</p>{"\n"}<p><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="Docusaurus blog post social card" src="/assets/images/social-card-5956610dd55e9725.png" width="1200" height="600" class="img_vXGZ" /></p></div><footer class="row docusaurus-mt-lg"><div class="col col--9"><b>Tags:</b><ul class="tags_rTaS padding--none margin-left--sm"><li class="tag_l5va"><a rel="tag" title="Blog posts about Docusaurus' new releases" class="tag_Nd8t tagRegular_TiLs" href="/blog/tags/release">Release</a></li></ul></div><div class="col text--right col--3"><a aria-label="Read more about Docusaurus 2.4" href="/blog/releases/2.4"><b>Read more</b></a></div></footer></article><article class="margin-bottom--xl"><header><h2 class="title_UBNu"><a href="/blog/releases/2.3">Docusaurus 2.3</a></h2><div class="container_x5Un margin-vert--md"><time datetime="2023-01-27T00:00:00.000Z">January 27, 2023</time> · 4 min read</div><div class="margin-top--md margin-bottom--sm row"><div class="col col--12 authorCol_bvyx"><div class="avatar margin-bottom--sm"><a class="avatar__photo-link" href="/blog/authors/slorber"><img class="avatar__photo authorImage_p8ow" src="https://github.com/slorber.png" alt="Sébastien Lorber" /></a><div class="avatar__intro authorDetails_dWdF"><div class="avatar__name"><a href="/blog/authors/slorber"><span class="authorName_Y8Hr" translate="no">Sébastien Lorber</span></a></div><small class="authorTitle_Slpj" title="Docusaurus maintainer, This Week In React editor">Docusaurus maintainer, This Week In React editor</small><div class="authorSocials_tPnL"><a href="https://bsky.app/profile/sebastienlorber.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="au